From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kierandrewett <kieran@drewett.dev>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 01:53:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] desktopentry: preserve the complete desktop action identifier

The group brackets have already been removed when finishCategory runs.
"Desktop Action " has 15 characters, so slicing at 16 drops the first
character of the action ID. This also merges distinct actions that share
the same suffix and makes single-character IDs empty.

Derive the offset from the matched prefix. DesktopAction.id must retain
the exact desktop-file identifier for callers that activate it via GIO.

Base: a1a150fab00a93ea983aaca5df55304bc837f51b (v0.2.1)
---
 src/core/desktopentry.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/core/desktopentry.cpp b/src/core/desktopentry.cpp
--- a/src/core/desktopentry.cpp
+++ b/src/core/desktopentry.cpp
@@ -131,7 +131,7 @@ ParsedDesktopEntryData DesktopEntry::parseText(const QString& id, const QString& te
 				else if (key == "Keywords") data.keywords = value.split(u';', Qt::SkipEmptyParts);
 			}
 		} else if (groupName.startsWith("Desktop Action ")) {
-			auto actionName = groupName.sliced(16);
+			auto actionName = groupName.sliced(QStringLiteral("Desktop Action ").size());
 			DesktopActionData action;
 			action.id = actionName;
 
